GNU Units 2.27

GNU Units was written by Adrian Mariano <adrianm@gnu.org>. Copyright (C)
Free Software Foundation, Inc. Distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later; see COPYING.

Source: GNU Units 2.27 release distribution. The units database and its
included data files are provided in app/src/main/assets.

Local change: use a character NUL instead of a null pointer constant when
terminating the locale string in units.c, for compatibility with Clang.
The build redirects GNU Units CLI exit() calls to the bridge fatal-error handler.
Guard continued-fraction integer conversions and arithmetic against overflow.
